values ('96e617f2-ebdf-4740-997f-eab99d776296', 'f34a2607-06a3-4c4b-8e3d-2315bc92afb5', 'The most unexpected question a client asked us', 14, 'Format: Storytelling + short reflection  Type: Business  Hook: “During a client call last month, someone asked me a question I didn’t expect. It completely changed how I think about our work…”', null, 'posted', '2025-11-05T06:00:00Z', '2025-11-05T06:00:00Z');
insert into public.posts (id, campaign_id, theme, position, body, linkedin_url, status, scheduled_at, posted_at)
values ('c1fd57a4-fc7f-42e1-8898-85034dbd5f7b', 'f34a2607-06a3-4c4b-8e3d-2315bc92afb5', 'A small joy moment (dog + ocean hike)', 15, 'Running a startup is intense.
There are constant deadlines, new challenges, and the pressure to always move forward.

But recently, I was reminded that joy can be very simple.

I took Dunia (my chihuahua) for a hike near the ocean.
We had water, snacks, and plenty of stops along the way, and as we walked through a
beautiful village and looked out at the sea, I realized how grounding these moments are.

It’s not about scaling a product, closing a deal, or hitting the next milestone.
It’s about balance, and remembering to be grateful for small, unexpected joys.

For me, that’s hiking with Dunia.
For you, it might be something else entirely.

 What’s a small moment that recently brought you joy?', null, 'posted', '2025-09-26T06:00:00Z', '2025-09-26T06:00:00Z');
insert into public.posts (id, campaign_id, theme, position, body, linkedin_url, status, scheduled_at, posted_at)
values ('d1697101-32bd-4c8d-aa7d-3f13d7dea962', 'f34a2607-06a3-4c4b-8e3d-2315bc92afb5', 'Turning self-doubt into a strength', 16, 'Self-doubt gets a bad reputation. In leadership, in startups, in decision-making - it’s usually labeled as a flaw.

But over the past year, I’ve realized that if you recognize it and apply it wisely, self-doubt can actually be a strength.

Here’s how I use it:

1) Double-checking solutions: “What if there’s a better approach?” or “Did I miss something?”
2) Polishing outcomes: Re-examining decisions often leads to stronger results.
3) Mindful application: The key is awareness - don’t overthink, but don’t ignore your doubts.

In running a wellness tech startup, every small improvement matters.
Self-doubt, when controlled, is not paralysis.

It’s a tool that helps me build better solutions for our users and strengthen our processes at CipherCross.

Leadership isn’t about never doubting yourself.
It’s about using your doubts to fuel better decisions.

How do you turn challenges or doubts into an advantage in your work?', 'https://www.linkedin.com/posts/mykyta-shevchenko-ciphercross-wellness_self-doubt-gets-a-bad-reputation-in-leadership-activity-7440298559100522496-ECKf?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAACKi8XsB9WBoWK1z6g7nRgrBaW3-4QoyJT8', 'posted', '2026-03-19T06:30:00Z', '2026-03-19T06:30:00Z');
