values ('c8e87bbe-6e03-47ef-8d70-4d205b5fc2b3', 'f34a2607-06a3-4c4b-8e3d-2315bc92afb5', 'Hiking as a way to recharge & generate ideas', 23, 'Type: LI Personal Post Text Post Idea: Share how long hikes (3–5 hours) help clear your mind, recharge, and often spark the best business ideas. Maybe connect it to balancing leadership stress. Hook: “Some of my best business ideas don’t come in meetings. They come after 3 hours of silence in nature.” Format: Personal photo (with dog Dunia on a hike).', 'https://www.linkedin.com/posts/mykyta-shevchenko-ciphercross-wellness_leadership-wellness-entrepreneurship-activity-7446806438100000768-T-xF?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAACKi8XsB9WBoWK1z6g7nRgrBaW3-4QoyJT8', 'posted', '2026-04-06T06:30:00Z', '2026-04-06T06:30:00Z');
