values ('efc5ec5f-1425-4205-b36b-4a2c9fd3671a', 'f34a2607-06a3-4c4b-8e3d-2315bc92afb5', 'My morning routine before deep work', 24, 'Type: LI Personal Post Text Post Idea: “I try not to open emails before 10 a.m. Instead 30 minutes of tennis, 15 minutes of silence, and one cup of coffee with no phone in hand. That short window of quiet often decides how productive the rest of the day will be. This morning routine about protecting clarity.”  Hook: “The best business habit I’ve built this year has nothing to do with meetings.”', 'https://www.linkedin.com/posts/mykyta-shevchenko-ciphercross-wellness_the-best-business-habit-ive-built-this-year-activity-7447180118063681536-md7x?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAACKi8XsB9WBoWK1z6g7nRgrBaW3-4QoyJT8', 'posted', '2026-04-07T07:15:00Z', '2026-04-07T07:15:00Z');
