values ('165fa812-08b5-44ce-b1cd-c61c3b473e66', 'f34a2607-06a3-4c4b-8e3d-2315bc92afb5', 'A podcast that shifted my perspective', 25, 'Type: LI Personal Knowledge Text Post Idea: “I didn’t expect one podcast episode to change how I think about leadership  but that’s what happened after listening to Mo Gawdat on The Diary of a CEO. He said something that stuck with me: ‘Happiness is like fitness  you have to train it.’ As someone building wellness products, this perspective reminded me that mental fitness deserves the same consistency as any startup sprint. We often push for efficiency, but sometimes the real growth comes from slowing down.”  Hook: “I didn’t expect one podcast episode to change how I think about leadership.”', 'https://www.linkedin.com/posts/mykyta-shevchenko-ciphercross-wellness_the-diary-of-a-ceo-the-33-laws-of-business-activity-7447882299687288833-r0La?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAACKi8XsB9WBoWK1z6g7nRgrBaW3-4QoyJT8', 'posted', '2026-04-09T05:45:00Z', '2026-04-09T05:45:00Z');
