values ('5cefc9aa-8362-404a-adde-576829f3f07b', 'f34a2607-06a3-4c4b-8e3d-2315bc92afb5', 'Notes app full of half-ideas', 26, 'Type: LI Personal Post Text Post Idea: “My Notes app is a mess random ideas, quotes, and app concepts written at 1 a.m. But every few months, one of those half-thoughts turns into something real at CipherCross. Some idea just needs to be captured.”  Hook: “Ideas just need a place to land.”', 'https://www.linkedin.com/posts/mykyta-shevchenko-ciphercross-wellness_my-notes-app-is-chaotic-random-ideas-activity-7449335574303232000-1Fz2?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAACKi8XsB9WBoWK1z6g7nRgrBaW3-4QoyJT8', 'posted', '2026-04-13T06:00:00Z', '2026-04-13T06:00:00Z');
