values ('cede108d-ab9f-424d-8440-95b06aa56862', 'f34a2607-06a3-4c4b-8e3d-2315bc92afb5', 'Wellbeing & founder habits', 28, 'Hook: “Some of my clearest ideas appear when I''m completely offline.”  Text Post Idea: Share the reality: That being offline — long walks, flights, days without Slack — sharpens strategic thinking better than any “productivity hack.”  Explain that:  silence → clarity  movement → creativity  distance → perspective  Tie back to CipherCross: To build mindful digital experiences, you also need mindful mental space.', 'https://www.linkedin.com/posts/mykyta-shevchenko-ciphercross-wellness_sometimes-my-best-strategic-thinking-happens-activity-7450434050823012352-wCPr?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAACKi8XsB9WBoWK1z6g7nRgrBaW3-4QoyJT8', 'posted', '2026-04-16T06:45:00Z', '2026-04-16T06:45:00Z');
