values ('9881661e-a3de-4690-b1da-674a96efd40c', 'f34a2607-06a3-4c4b-8e3d-2315bc92afb5', 'The intersection of tech and empathy', 29, 'Type: LI Personal Knowledge Text Post Idea: “Technology can optimize, automate, accelerate, but can it care? At CipherCross, we believe wellness tech must be built with empathy at its core. Because progress without compassion isn’t sustainable. Empathy is a scaling strategy.”  Hook: “Empathy is a scaling strategy.”', 'https://www.linkedin.com/posts/mykyta-shevchenko-ciphercross-wellness_empathy-is-a-new-metric-activity-7452253599889334272-g8A9?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAACKi8XsB9WBoWK1z6g7nRgrBaW3-4QoyJT8', 'posted', '2026-04-21T07:15:00Z', '2026-04-21T07:15:00Z');
