values ('5473ae18-874c-4bd9-a59a-0e3bfed0cac8', 'f34a2607-06a3-4c4b-8e3d-2315bc92afb5', 'Leadership & team culture', 30, 'Hook: “A team that genuinely cares can move faster than any roadmap.”  Text Post Idea: Share how motivating it is to work with people who are passionate, supportive, and excited about the product.  Highlight that your favorite part is not the technical milestones — but the energy when everyone collaborates, debates, and brings ideas to life.  Leadership insight: Culture is built in small moments — daily check-ins, honest conversations, shared wins.  Tie back to wellness tech: You can’t create supportive products without a supportive internal culture.', 'https://www.linkedin.com/posts/mykyta-shevchenko-ciphercross-wellness_a-team-that-genuinely-cares-can-move-faster-activity-7452736741339275265-IbkL?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAACKi8XsB9WBoWK1z6g7nRgrBaW3-4QoyJT8', 'posted', '2026-04-22T15:15:00Z', '2026-04-22T15:15:00Z');
