insert into public.posts (id, campaign_id, theme, position, body, linkedin_url, status, scheduled_at, posted_at)
values ('27c0de61-3e7b-4d82-886e-92e14e44687a', '969b6828-7641-4509-9a99-50ec4877e157', 'Raves, Waves, and Remote Teams – Why Founders Need to Stay Human', 0, 'Raves, Waves, and Remote Teams – Why Founders Need to Stay Human

 I co-lead a mental health and wellness tech company.
 But sometimes, I recharge by dancing all night at a Berlin rave.

 Here’s my honest admission:
 while my days are often filled with product meetings, team standups,
 and championing digital wellbeing
 I find my balance in the most unexpected places.

 One of the weekends, I swapped spreadsheets for strobes
 and joined friends at a Berlin techno club.

 There’s something about losing yourself
 for hours in music and movement that
 brings you back to your core.
 What might look like just a wild night out
 is my way of hitting “reset,” coming back
 to work with a clearer mind and a lighter spirit.

 Why is it important for me?

→ Personal rituals fuel professional clarity.
 Whether it’s riding ocean waves, hiking at sunrise,
 or owning the dancefloor deep into the night - these moments
 outside business boundaries remind me
 how to be present, curious, and creative.

→ Leadership is more human when life is lived fully.
 The best decisions (and innovations) often
 come after we’ve stepped away and recharged,
 not when we’re glued to endless screens.

→ Remote teams thrive on real stories.
 When I share my life - the fun, the music,
 The messy - our team feels safer to do the same.
 It’s the shortest route I know to genuine trust and connection.

 So, here’s to…

→ Letting passions outside work fuel your purpose inside it.
 → Staying human in a digital world - on the dancefloor,
 on the shore, and remote calls with your crew.

 What’s your go-to reset?
 How do you keep your spark alive while building big things?

 Share your own story or favorite ritual below.
 I’d love to get inspired by your vibe, too.

FoundersLife #HumanLeadership #WellnessTech #RemoteTeams #PersonalGrowth #WorkLifeBalance #StayHuman

  - photo from the rave', null, 'posted', '2025-08-05T08:00:00Z', '2025-08-05T08:00:00Z');
