values ('a6a6724d-bddd-485f-954d-0cf00e0e8d72', '969b6828-7641-4509-9a99-50ec4877e157', 'What ‘Wellness-Driven Work Culture’ Means at CipherCross', 23, 'Type: LI Company Post / Personal Insight Hook: “Wellness isn’t just what we build. It’s how we work.” Text Post Idea: Behind the scenes of CipherCross work style: async respect, Slack shoutouts for help, team wins log, deep work mornings, no unnecessary calls, privacy-first mindset in product and communication. Show how wellness is not only tech — it’s operational values. Format: Team photo / office setup / Slack screenshot blur', 'https://www.linkedin.com/posts/mykyta-shevchenko-ciphercross_founderlife-decisionmaking-wellnesstech-activity-7442476693019258880-QWbT?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAAD1GaXQBLC3IwzuWDrLQoIsrw5Y1tC2y1Xs', 'posted', '2026-03-25T06:45:00Z', '2026-03-25T06:45:00Z');
