values ('010f99eb-b3ef-4a9f-ae11-c5d69c1bef52', '969b6828-7641-4509-9a99-50ec4877e157', 'Trend take — longevity & healthspan', 51, 'Type: LI Personal Knowledge Text Post Idea: Mykyta’s perspective on longevity in 2026: shift from anti‑aging to healthspan, realistic product opportunities, and how startups can avoid the “sticker shock” trap. Hook: Longevity isn’t about living longer at all costs — it’s about living better Format (Optional): 3 practical opportunities for startups (data, affordability, human touch).', null, 'posted', '2026-06-02T07:00:00Z', '2026-06-02T07:00:00Z');
