values ('c7654bfc-6d18-4bbd-b7cf-4d932c5718b9', '969b6828-7641-4509-9a99-50ec4877e157', 'Team & product rituals', 52, 'Type: LI Personal Post Text Post Idea: A behind-the-scenes snapshot of a CipherCross weekly product ritual (e.g., “wellness hour” demo or user-story readout), why it exists, and one unexpected insight that came from it. Hook: We block one hour every week to read real user stories Format (Optional): Photo of the team around a screen or remote meeting screenshot.', null, 'posted', '2026-06-03T05:30:00Z', '2026-06-03T05:30:00Z');
