values ('a84af9e0-72a0-4e60-98c9-16e001458636', '969b6828-7641-4509-9a99-50ec4877e157', 'FemTech / women’s health', 58, 'Type: LI Personal Knowledge Text Post Idea: Quick explainer on why FemTech is a priority for wellness apps in 2026, product opportunities (smart patches, peri‑menopause flows), and how CipherCross approaches inclusive research and testing. Hook: Women’s health data are finally getting the product love they deserve Format (Optional): Bullet list of 3 product features to prioritize.', null, 'approved', '2026-06-17T05:00:00Z', null);
insert into public.posts (id, campaign_id, theme, position, body, linkedin_url, status, scheduled_at, posted_at)
values ('55965b31-44d4-4e7c-9f2e-017506332476', '969b6828-7641-4509-9a99-50ec4877e157', 'Building for “non‑tech” wellness users', 59, 'Wellness App Security: Why HIPAA Compliance is Non-Negotiable

In digital health trust begins with privacy. It’s not just about passing a compliance audit, it’s about building security into every product from day one.

At CipherCross, HIPAA compliance is a foundation, not a final step. Here’s how we put that into practice:

→ Security protocols by design - Every wellness app is architected with privacy and protection built in from the start.

→ Anonymized and encrypted data - User data is never exposed, thanks to layered safeguards.

→ Proven compliance - We deliver solutions that are 100% HIPAA-compliant, eliminating the risk of last-minute setbacks.

This isn’t only a technical standard - it’s a cultural commitment. Our team ensures that security remains central to the user experience, so trust is never compromised.

In wellness tech, if users can’t trust that their data is safe, they won’t trust the product itself.

Want to see what secure wellness looks like in practice? Contact us for a walkthrough.', null, 'approved', '2026-06-18T16:30:00Z', null);
