values ('7380b457-9f9d-41b4-9304-b83e847378ae', '62b02c62-e03e-4c72-9fc7-058c87b3d847', 'The values we build on', 1, 'Format: Brand manifesto Type: Vision / Culture Hook:  Wellness isn’t just our product. It’s how we build. It’s how we work. It’s who we are.  Body idea: Outline your values:  People-first approach  Caring for users and employees equally  Building trust, not just software  Working with clients, not for them Then mention how these values shape product decisions and long-term partnerships.  CTA: → Let’s build something meaningful together: ciphercross.com', null, 'posted', '2025-08-15T15:15:00Z', '2025-08-15T15:15:00Z');
