values ('d88dd60f-dd6a-40a9-8bdc-8dd3a09ee0da', '62b02c62-e03e-4c72-9fc7-058c87b3d847', 'The 90% Retention Blueprint', 7, 'Format: Case study post with anonymized results Type: Proof / Results Hook: "How one wellness app kept over 90% of its users coming back daily." Body Idea: Share the anonymized story of a client who went from struggling to retain users to hitting a 90% retention rate and tripling revenue after working with CipherCross. Highlight the key changes you implemented — UX improvements, personalization, consistent feature updates. Include a simple before/after graphic. CTA: "What’s the biggest retention challenge you’ve faced in your digital product?"', 'https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7444269754137067520', 'posted', '2026-03-30T06:30:00Z', '2026-03-30T06:30:00Z');
