insert into public.posts (id, campaign_id, theme, position, body, linkedin_url, status, scheduled_at, posted_at)
values ('b5282cef-1bd0-4acb-b0d4-f824b3b71049', '62b02c62-e03e-4c72-9fc7-058c87b3d847', 'Real Impact: How Wellness Apps Improve User Retention', 10, 'Your smartwatch knows your pulse. But does it help you recover from burnout?

Most wellness apps just show metrics, but real value comes from action.
At CipherCross, we transform wearable insights into personalized, practical nudges.

Here’s how we turn data into meaningful wellness actions:

HRV → “Take 10 minutes to walk and reset cortisol levels.”

Sleep stages → “Try deep breathing before bed to improve HRV.”

Step cadence → “Take a quick movement break to maintain focus and energy.”

These small, evidence-based interventions help users manage stress, recover faster and form healthier daily habits.

Learn how CipherCross can turn your wellness app data into real impact → <https://ciphercross.com>', null, 'pending', null, null);
insert into public.posts (id, campaign_id, theme, position, body, linkedin_url, status, scheduled_at, posted_at)
values ('8e3badb4-cdfa-42cd-be6b-3e4970b029f2', '62b02c62-e03e-4c72-9fc7-058c87b3d847', 'Meet the Makers: The CipherCross Product Team', 11, 'Meet the Makers: The CipherCross Team

Great tech is built by great people. Behind every one of our 42+ successful wellness apps stands a team of developers, designers and compliance experts who share one mission: building secure, human-centered digital wellbeing solutions.

This week, we’re excited to introduce the people behind CipherCross, which brings not only expertise in wellness tech but also a unique perspective on balance, mindfulness and creativity:

