Natalia Goryanina, Full-Stack  Developer - ensures every app scales securely and efficiently. Favorite practice: meditation walks.(?)

Oleksii Synelnyk, Full-Stack Developer - bridging backend performance with seamless frontend delivery to keep wellness apps reliable and scalable. Mindfulness: (?)

Serhii Zakharov, React Native Developer - turning wellness concepts into mobile-first experiences with smooth, intuitive interactions. Mindfulness: Weekend hikes in nature (?)

Because building for wellness means living it, too.

→ Interested in joining a team that builds tech for good? Watch this space for new openings!', null, 'pending', null, null);
insert into public.posts (id, campaign_id, theme, position, body, linkedin_url, status, scheduled_at, posted_at)
values ('d2c52aa3-190d-4a55-b41d-066b042e3991', '62b02c62-e03e-4c72-9fc7-058c87b3d847', 'From Concept to Launch - Faster, Safer, Smarter', 12, 'Text Post Idea: Most wellness founders lose months building infrastructure before they can even test their idea. CipherCross’s new AI-assisted wellness app framework helps startups go from concept to compliant launch in record time — with built-in HIPAA/GDPR readiness and adaptive personalization. We’re helping innovators focus on what matters: creating meaningful wellness experiences, not managing complexity. Hook: “Turning wellness ideas into compliant products — in weeks, not months.” Format (Optional): Carousel or infographic explaining the “Concept → Prototype → Compliant Launch” journey.', 'https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7440309818780880897', 'posted', '2026-03-19T07:00:00Z', '2026-03-19T07:00:00Z');
