values ('9d09ec5c-ba48-4e1c-bdad-1c4822a1feee', '62b02c62-e03e-4c72-9fc7-058c87b3d847', 'Resetting After a Wellness Relapse', 18, 'Topic: How to Restart Without Guilt Type: LI Useful Post Text Post Idea: Users often feel guilty for stopping wellness routines. Share CipherCross approach: 3-step restart method — micro-goal, supportive notification, no-negative scoring. Add 2–3 psychology-backed tips (CBT micro-interventions). Hook: “Missed workouts, skipped meditation? You didn’t fail. You’re human — here’s how to restart.” Format: Text + Saveable checklist graphic', 'https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7447878494262431744', 'posted', '2026-04-09T05:30:00Z', '2026-04-09T05:30:00Z');
