values ('4445c49c-48ce-4f5d-8a02-3bd997bca589', '62b02c62-e03e-4c72-9fc7-058c87b3d847', 'Case Study: 32% Drop in Burnout for Corporate Client', 23, 'Topic: Employer Wellness That Actually Works Type: LI Case Post Text Post Idea: Show results from a corporate client using CipherCross for employee wellness. Share metrics: 32% drop in burnout symptoms, +18% focus retention, -25% absenteeism after 10 weeks. Explain method: micro-interventions (2–5 min), AI-coach + human supervision, privacy-first data storage. Hook: “Corporate wellness isn’t yoga mats and fruit baskets anymore.” Format: Case carousel (Before → Solution → Results → Quote)', 'https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7452250266281746432', 'posted', '2026-04-21T07:00:00Z', '2026-04-21T07:00:00Z');
