values ('876dc36d-c1fe-4168-b768-7308552a6332', '62b02c62-e03e-4c72-9fc7-058c87b3d847', 'Science, Empathy & Trust — The Core of Our Work', 24, 'Type: LI Case/Company Post Text Post Idea: Our mission at CipherCross is simple: build digital wellness solutions that people trust. To do that, we bring together security experts, UX designers, and behavioral scientists — creating wellness ecosystems that feel human, not robotic. Every click is designed to empower, not overwhelm. Hook: Wellness isn’t just what your app does — it’s how it makes people feel.', 'https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7452604663218163712', 'posted', '2026-04-22T06:30:00Z', '2026-04-22T06:30:00Z');
