values ('0e96565f-420b-4e0b-9da5-3c99ac5a85d5', '62b02c62-e03e-4c72-9fc7-058c87b3d847', 'AI Journaling That Helps You Understand Yourself', 28, 'Type: LI Company Post Text Post Idea: We’ve launched Capture Journals — an AI-powered journaling app that turns handwritten notes into structured insights. Users can scan their notebook pages, receive clean digital text, and get clarity through AI summaries and gentle guidance. It’s journaling designed for real life — simple, fast, and deeply personal. Hook: Your handwriting has a story, now it finally has structure.', 'https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7455526642459869184', 'posted', '2026-04-30T08:00:00Z', '2026-04-30T08:00:00Z');
