values ('7a811d0a-88ca-42ec-82b3-05f1e86481c9', '62b02c62-e03e-4c72-9fc7-058c87b3d847', 'Turning Wellness Ideas Into Production-Ready Digital Products', 38, 'Hook: Many great wellness ideas stay ideas because the technical path is unclear Text Post Idea: Describe how companies can move from concept → prototype → production without rebuilding systems later.  Mention the importance of:  Early architecture planning  Testing real user flows  Designing for growth  Format: Mini roadmap (3 stages)', null, 'posted', '2026-05-26T06:00:00Z', '2026-05-26T06:00:00Z');
