insert into public.posts (id, campaign_id, theme, position, body, linkedin_url, status, scheduled_at, posted_at)
values ('b414daea-ac66-4d75-8360-28b9edb56afb', '17f1612e-5938-415a-b812-8b00dc905d0f', 'A Camera, a Mountain, and My Creative Reset', 0, 'Format: Personal photo from a hike or film camera shot + story Type: Personal Hook: "Some of my best work decisions come after a mountain trail and a roll of film." Here''s how hiking and analog photography help me return to work with sharper intuition and a calmer mind..', null, 'approved', '2025-08-05T08:00:00Z', null);
insert into public.posts (id, campaign_id, theme, position, body, linkedin_url, status, scheduled_at, posted_at)
values ('0c8468d2-2a9c-47d7-9a39-0ad64cedbbc3', '17f1612e-5938-415a-b812-8b00dc905d0f', 'The Mental Health App We All Deserve', 1, 'When we first connected with this wellness app, they faced a challenge many digital health products know too well: users loved the concept, but engagement dropped dramatically after the first week.

Together, we focused on three core changes:

1) UX optimization - making navigation intuitive and friction-free.
2) Personalization - delivering content, reminders, and features aligned with each user’s unique wellness journey.
3) Consistent feature updates - ensuring fresh, valuable reasons to log in daily.

The results were remarkable. Within six months:

→  Daily active user retention rose to over 90%.
→  Revenue tripled as engaged users became loyal subscribers.
→  Average session time increased by 45%, signaling deeper, more meaningful interactions.

This transformation wasn’t about adding more features - it was about creating an experience people truly wanted to return to every single day.

At CipherCross, we specialize in helping wellness and mental health products not only attract users but keep them for the long run.

What’s the biggest retention challenge you’ve faced in your digital product?

 Learn more about how we help wellness products grow:[ https://ciphercross.com](https://ciphercross.com)', null, 'approved', '2025-08-06T08:00:00Z', null);
insert into public.posts (id, campaign_id, theme, position, body, linkedin_url, status, scheduled_at, posted_at)
values ('31a8211d-6925-4b3d-b09f-b1aaf0b901e8', '17f1612e-5938-415a-b812-8b00dc905d0f', 'My Morning Checklist for a Clearer Day', 2, 'My Morning Checklist for a Clearer Day

Before Slack, before email, before the noise - I do these 3 things.

No fancy hacks.
 Just the simple habits that
 keep me grounded and focused before I step into work mode.

1. Open the Window, Breathe In
 Before I even touch my phone,
 I pull back the curtains and let in the daylight.
 Fresh air and a few quiet breaths
 clear the mind - no agenda, just a moment for myself.

2. Tea Ritual & Gratitude
 A warm cup of tea and a few minutes with my journal.
 I jot down one thing I’m grateful for and one thing
 I want to approach with intention today.
 This ritual helps shift my mind from autopilot to presence.

3. Desk Reset
 I spend a minute tidying up my workspace, putting away yesterday’s clutter.
 A clean desk signals a fresh start and helps me focus on what matters.

These small steps make a big difference,
 especially in a world full of constant notifications
 and busy schedules.

They remind me that clarity and calm are choices I can make every morning.

What’s your favorite way to start the day with intention?

MorningRoutine #WellbeingAtWork #CustomerSuccess #MindfulLeadership #StartWithPurpose', null, 'approved', '2025-08-07T08:00:00Z', null);
