values ('29208459-147e-4dd0-b4b1-3ae263a9f74f', '17f1612e-5938-415a-b812-8b00dc905d0f', 'Why Most Wellness Apps Fail (and How We Build Differently)', 3, 'Format: Insight carousel (3 myths + 3 truths) Type: Business / Knowledge Hook: "It’s not about more features. It’s about fewer barriers." The wellness space is crowded — but real impact comes from clarity, care, and consistency. Here’s how we rethink product design at CipherCross.', null, 'approved', '2025-08-13T08:00:00Z', null);
